  "0001104659-26-017090": [
   {
    "what": "Whether a prior-period comparative column restated inside a current filing's table (here the 13 weeks and 52 weeks ended December 31, 2024 comparable-sales rates) is in scope as a fact of THIS event, or belongs only to the earlier event that first stated it.",
    "why": "The rules fix period resolution and forbid duplicate facts within a reply, but no rule states a scope filter for restated comparatives; I settled the row by emitting every stated period value with its own explicit period framing, yet a contract decision is needed so this choice is uniform across events rather than reader-by-reader."
   }
  ]
